                <l xml:id="m-9976905d-0284-4452-9e7a-d6eeb2954e7c" facs="#m-1d57a76c-6605-426d-a2db-e74af99bdb09" label="ambiguous">1i8</l><l xml:id="m-08316be3-7f17-4c47-a590-69b8ab78dfa0" facs="#m-e86a1b8d-97ce-45b9-b0d7-8ce8e8f43941" label="text-like">Common of Apostles and Evangelists. P. T.</l><l xml:id="m-d041f852-5823-4b58-be24-3d36777b5cea" facs="#m-fb30755e-263a-44f8-a486-a677c05a05b7" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-9d0862a8-b1b8-4295-a19f-8168fc272503" facs="#m-b5fd6215-a97b-497c-b99e-cb0e32f1be64" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1. 82</l><l xml:id="m-6e9ff1fb-1e6b-42bf-b8c2-0f816d596842" facs="#m-7cfae8b9-8086-43ac-97de-7fe479530bef" label="lyrics-like">-stó-te fórtes in béllo, * et pugná-te cum an¬</l><l xml:id="m-7dd6c9ba-0ae3-4f03-8bfc-130904d021f8" facs="#m-cd814b18-b51d-4970-8908-5b9a896b4c6e" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-1d789b6f-e669-413f-b1d1-f9f5d26613a7" facs="#m-dd4d87d5-6a73-4844-992c-91b520cf10e3" label="lyrics-like">tíquo serpénte: et ac-ci-pi-é-tis régnum aetérnum, t alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-38e28cf2-dbef-4507-bb8f-eec675036d5d" facs="#m-dbd6b7a3-f2ab-4fe3-b515-99c93aa3ff16" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia. After Septuag:t dí cit Dóminus. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-0ef138f7-d680-499e-a46f-e93722af5cf5" facs="#m-0ff7a889-75a9-408e-81c9-f76b6639d82f" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. I. g a. p. 207, or p. 213. — The prayer is found in</l><l xml:id="m-bd04ac10-6134-4424-ac56-f8132a560b83" facs="#m-df0320b0-0855-4de3-a4d1-c3a21e45e21a" label="text-like">the Proper of the Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-0183c797-6e59-401b-9485-83e38d1297db" facs="#m-a3b3943a-5b31-4b4a-98ae-ec2a3c51b43e" label="text-like">Compline of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-8ce7bc95-c754-4313-af91-25c8c1506eb6" facs="#m-39646a8b-197e-4a01-8de5-0ab5c4b3d23e" label="ambiguous">  o</l><l xml:id="m-fad5c01a-55d6-4114-be4b-9a48a946e781" facs="#m-57c0fdc9-46e1-40be-a9c3-ad2add0d99bb" label="ambiguous">COMMON</l><l xml:id="m-c0a5b9ac-1c74-4ad7-92f3-95717cffb5f2" facs="#m-31fdf2a8-36a0-4ed9-a718-96ecbd5494ce" label="text-like">OF APOSTLES AND OF EVANGELISTS</l><l xml:id="m-64dd4c8a-4cb4-43d5-9d34-214e66af7cf6" facs="#m-17514354-cc2f-453a-9e69-d87558ff8e6f" label="text-like">IN PASCHAL TIME.</l><l xml:id="m-91bafa00-6ad0-472f-b85c-dc0fd825f7e8" facs="#m-96df86ad-e433-40e8-89e5-9cbde8cde5d0" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-fd0f55bb-0b0e-40ab-a9aa-519988019001" facs="#m-27bbeb04-c919-450f-86b6-5d4d5191c58f" label="text-like">The Psalms of first Vespers are indicated at second Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-dc7432af-9681-4cec-8d0f-59770aba2ad6" facs="#m-78b9b88c-f78e-4634-9559-c81d2adcecc7" label="text-like">Antiphons, Chapter, and Hymn of and Vespers, p. 1120.</l><l xml:id="m-7fb88c8e-6cea-44e6-9348-94c43b37454f" facs="#m-41606739-cabf-441d-aee3-9a745534a9d6" label="lyrics-like">V. Sáncti et jústi in Dómino gaudéte, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-ec7fcf7f-109f-4f85-84f5-49cf52f11202" facs="#m-1cab733a-7c55-47b1-a259-65a1e29595c6" label="lyrics-like">B. Vos elégit Déus in haereditátem sibi, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-599daf0a-e666-43a4-b0f1-fb7f8b337441" facs="#m-dbad182c-fffb-4818-9d0e-504be3d9179f" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-4ee3bfac-8cfd-4a53-8c92-8c0693aae0e0" facs="#m-2f816f0e-f36b-4116-8048-a3735f4befa7" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.g</l><l xml:id="m-b4637468-5d40-4b96-9d58-c34e55d0068f" facs="#m-65aa4523-2413-464c-86d6-bc2923d2d813" label="ambiguous">L</l><l xml:id="m-bf7b8ca4-aa3d-4732-b005-ad9d008e62d0" facs="#m-94133bcd-1ac0-485d-a22d-4100695c0d56" label="lyrics-like">UX perpé-tu-a “lu-cébit Sánctis tú-is, Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-32780eb3-c39c-4edb-b352-d7cb3efe260b" facs="#m-ba6c4c45-eff8-4e2a-b544-ceaeb2911b12" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-f04317e6-2c1a-4461-ac20-1a0eeae581ec" facs="#m-cea68d9c-a06a-460c-a5f2-a7757cd4f221" label="lyrics-like">aetérni-tas témporum, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-1c059ee9-4a27-421a-997b-fa7303175e03" facs="#m-abf498f8-0f0e-467a-9ef1-c840f471f1ca" label="ambiguous">et</l><l xml:id="m-0248cba8-0160-481f-bff3-496d6ca9f0b4" facs="#m-8e6b6ec2-431a-4914-88be-9e125f81be17" label="ambiguous">ne:</l><l xml:id="m-ddf7464b-87b3-4b85-97fe-b707bef9e15a" facs="#m-eaa6520a-4e90-4f24-b05a-d1248e35b90d" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-87ead091-eb75-422b-a1fd-5ee0f6df5ac5" facs="#m-69755f0a-435f-47ca-8496-c765d67bb48f" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. I. g. p. 207, or p. 213. — The Prayer is found in the</l><l xml:id="m-78fef44f-8567-45fe-bb1f-05979e71bec9" facs="#m-3fe559fa-10f1-42b9-bb7d-9027f075196c" label="lyrics-like">Proper of thé Saints.</l><l xml:id="m-55fc7f06-eeb7-4654-86ad-7e7cbc98cba4" facs="#m-73ea74dd-fda5-40fd-a01a-5b93b4b12213" label="text-like">Compline of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-9bb58c71-e847-40b7-bf8b-26b18765a073" facs="#m-0b5bd81e-b1f5-402e-a46d-8aa7660ec12c" label="text-like">At Compline and at the Little Hours, the hymns are sung in the tone for</l><l xml:id="m-3011e6ee-8073-4a26-9755-33f9c1602e25" facs="#m-571b0060-5a29-4cdb-a078-cb77f67145d1" label="text-like">Paschat Time.</l><l xml:id="m-9a600f8e-8c26-48e3-aacf-7bab598b1db3" facs="#m-2e01af20-739e-4bb6-a71b-bdfa0233e529" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Sáncti túi. p. 1120. Psalms of Feasts, p. 226. Short</l><l xml:id="m-40d87b3d-f4bb-48cd-b899-05741be4b9a7" facs="#m-37ba9e98-c626-4237-be6f-a39a5031b293" label="lyrics-like">Lesson. Scimus quóniam. p. 1119.</l></lg>
            </div>
